{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02883","headline":"奉和别鲁王 · 李敬玄","name":"奉和别鲁王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿车旋楚服，丹跸伫秦川。\n珠皐转归骑，金岸引行旃。\n一朝限原隰，千里间风烟。\n莺喧上林谷，凫响御沟泉。\n断云移鲁盖，离歌动舜弦。\n别念凝神扆，崇恩洽玳筵。\n顾惟慙叩寂，徒自仰钧天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李敬玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}